OL,3,GNEWSAFour pumpkin patches targeted by
OL,4,Avandal smashers
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe owners of four pumpkin patches have
OL,7,Fbeen left picking up the pieces after
OL,8,Fthey said they were destroyed by
OL,9,Fchildren.
OL,11,FFamily-run patches in Woodbridge, East
OL,12,FBergholt, Ipswich and Barton Mills, all
OL,13,Fin Suffolk, said they had to use
OL,14,Fwheelbarrows to clear up the smashed
OL,15,FHalloween treats.
OL,17,FFarmers said the squash-squashers acted
OL,18,Fin plain sight, filming their
OL,19,Fbehaviour, and some customers reported
OL,20,Fseeing parents laughing during the
OL,21,Fdestruction.
OL,23,APub: 31-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
