OL,3,GNEWSAFour pumpkin patches targeted by
OL,4,Avandal smashers
OL,5,
OL,6,FSuffolk Police asked the public to be
OL,7,Frespectful but also said it was
OL,8,F"heartening" to see some local people
OL,9,Fclearing up the mess.
